        <title>Keyspace Beijing 北京</title>
        <published>2025-12-13T01:01:01+00:00</published><updated>2025-12-13T01:01:01+00:00</updated>
        
        <author>
          <name>Unknown</name>
        </author>
        
        <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://madolson.github.io/valkey-io.github.io/pr-21/events/keyspace-beijing-2025/"/>
        <id>https://madolson.github.io/valkey-io.github.io/pr-21/events/keyspace-beijing-2025/</id>
        
        <content type="html" xml:base="https://madolson.github.io/valkey-io.github.io/pr-21/events/keyspace-beijing-2025/">&lt;p&gt;Keyspace 北京峰会是开发者、SRE 和 DevOps 专家齐聚一堂，分享 Valkey 的技术、最佳实践和新用途的盛会。您将在为期一天的活动中与项目维护人员、社区爱好者和思想领袖见面交流。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Keyspace Beijing is the event where developers, SREs, and DevOps pros gather to share techniques, best practices, and new uses for Valkey. You’ll meet and network with the project maintainers, community enthusiasts, and thought leaders in a focused one-day event.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;ri-qi-when&quot;&gt;日期 / When&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;2025年12月13日&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dec 13, 2025&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;di-dian-where&quot;&gt;地点 / Where&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;东升大厦A座 北京市海淀区中关村东路8号
(五道口地铁站A北口步行490米)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dongsheng Building, Tower A, No. 8 Zhongguancun East Road, Haidian District, Beijing (490 meters walk from North Exit A of Wudaokou Subway Station)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;yan-shi-pdf-presentation-slides&quot;&gt;演示 PDF / Presentation Slides&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://madolson.github.io/valkey-io.github.io/pr-21/events/keyspace-beijing-2025/./slides/%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E6%98%AFValkey%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%8E%E8%AF%9E%E7%94%9F%E5%88%B0%E6%9C%AA%E6%9D%A5%E5%8F%91%E5%B1%95%E6%96%B9%E5%90%91.pdf&quot;&gt;什么是 Valkey：从诞生到未来发展方向&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://madolson.github.io/valkey-io.github.io/pr-21/events/keyspace-beijing-2025/./slides/Valkey-Dual-Channel-Replication.pdf&quot;&gt;Valkey Dual Channel Replication&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://madolson.github.io/valkey-io.github.io/pr-21/events/keyspace-beijing-2025/./slides/Valkey%E9%AB%98%E5%8F%AF%E7%94%A8%E5%88%87%E6%8D%A2%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E6%BC%94%E8%BF%9B%E5%8F%8A%E6%9C%80%E4%BD%B3%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5.pdf&quot;&gt;Valkey 高可用切换技术演进及最佳实践&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://madolson.github.io/valkey-io.github.io/pr-21/events/keyspace-beijing-2025/./slides/%E5%9F%BA%E4%BA%8EValkey%E6%9E%84%E5%BB%BA%E8%B6%85%E5%A4%A7%E8%A7%84%E6%A8%A1%E7%9A%84%E9%9B%86%E7%BE%A4%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1.pdf&quot;&gt;基于 Valkey 构建超大规模的集群服务&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://madolson.github.io/valkey-io.github.io/pr-21/events/keyspace-beijing-2025/./slides/Valkey-Cluster-Atomic-Slot-Migration.pdf&quot;&gt;Valkey Cluster Atomic Slot Migration&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://madolson.github.io/valkey-io.github.io/pr-21/events/keyspace-beijing-2025/./slides/Valkey-Hash-Field-Expiration%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%BB.pdf&quot;&gt;Valkey Hash Field Expiration 特性解读&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://madolson.github.io/valkey-io.github.io/pr-21/events/keyspace-beijing-2025/./slides/Valkey-Over-RDMA%EF%BC%9A%E6%9E%81%E8%87%B4%E7%9A%84%E9%AB%98%E6%80%A7%E8%83%BDKV%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8.pdf&quot;&gt;Valkey Over RDMA: 极致的高性能 KV 存储&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://madolson.github.io/valkey-io.github.io/pr-21/events/keyspace-beijing-2025/./slides/Valkey-Over-MPTCP.pdf&quot;&gt;Valkey Over MPTCP&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://madolson.github.io/valkey-io.github.io/pr-21/events/keyspace-beijing-2025/./slides/Valkey%E5%A4%9A%E5%8F%AF%E7%94%A8%E5%8C%BA%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5.pdf&quot;&gt;Valkey 多可用区部署实践&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</content>
        
